        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e77c792d-b385-3ed0-af8d-d9d53763685c",
                "word": "чудом",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b0a75dc-00d3-3546-b9d3-758aee419c70",
                        "entry_id": "e77c792d-b385-3ed0-af8d-d9d53763685c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "случайным, необъяснимым, удивительным образом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9134c5f9-aa5f-459e-9840-a3b1b6c8358c",
                                "sense_id": "1b0a75dc-00d3-3546-b9d3-758aee419c70",
                                "text": "Жизнь его вне опасности. Вот уж именно спасшийся чудом!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b6aff7c-6ccc-4db1-b082-927955dcab5b",
                                "sense_id": "1b0a75dc-00d3-3546-b9d3-758aee419c70",
                                "text": "Что если бы чудом настоящее оказалось сном, страшным кошмаром, и мы проснулись бы обновленные, чистые, сильные, гордые своею правдой?.."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83316cf1-f58d-45fd-b5e2-4a9c9731740e",
                                "sense_id": "1b0a75dc-00d3-3546-b9d3-758aee419c70",
                                "text": "Если чудом и доплывет, то разобьется о камни…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e198e7b-9a9c-4b46-83ed-c87e2864f853",
                        "source_entry_id": "e77c792d-b385-3ed0-af8d-d9d53763685c",
                        "source_sense_id": "1b0a75dc-00d3-3546-b9d3-758aee419c70",
                        "target_lang_word": "miraculously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "miraculously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a29ebce-e93b-39a6-99c5-b86f106b92f5",
                                        "entry_id": "0e80813c-9b97-3cde-b75d-104dcd1ddda2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a miraculous manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff0dcc4b-fc25-4c4a-8115-f2b416bae023",
                                                "sense_id": "4a29ebce-e93b-39a6-99c5-b86f106b92f5",
                                                "text": "When he woke for the second time he saw me, and began to question me as to what had happened, but I had to put him off as best I could till the morrow, when he awoke almost miraculously better."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c822698-7fc7-4ed9-b5b6-fcb0085b1f66",
                                                "sense_id": "4a29ebce-e93b-39a6-99c5-b86f106b92f5",
                                                "text": "Almost miraculously, [risk-neutral valuation] finesses the problem that we know hardly anything about the risk aversion of the buyers and sellers of options."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
